            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="standard-card">
            <div class="standard-badge">Environment</div>
            <h4>3. Credentials by security scheme</h4>
            <p>
              Each scheme reads an environment variable named after it in upper snake case (<code>petstore_auth</code> &rarr; <code>PETSTORE_AUTH</code>), with <code>API_KEY</code> as the fallback for any scheme. HTTP Basic takes <code>user:password</code> or <code>&lt;NAME&gt;_USERNAME</code> / <code>&lt;NAME&gt;_PASSWORD</code>. <code>API_BASE_URL</code> overrides the base URL. The Claude Desktop and Cursor config has one <code>env</code> entry per scheme.
            </p>
          </div>

